  /// class, valid values are 128, 256, 512, 1024, 2048, or 4096 KiB, with a
  /// default of 1024 KiB. For all other file systems, valid values are 4, 8,
  /// 16, 32, 64, 128, 256, 512, or 1024 KiB, with a default of 128 KiB. We
  /// recommend using the default setting for the majority of use cases.
