  /// 6144 MBps. Amazon FSx responds with an HTTP status code 400 (Bad
  /// Request) for the following conditions: The value of ThroughputCapacity
  /// and ThroughputCapacityPerHAPair are not the same value for file systems
  /// with one HA pair. The value of deployment type is SINGLE_AZ_2 and
