  /// even if they have active retention periods. PERMANENTLY_DISABLED is a
  /// terminal state. If privileged delete is permanently disabled on a
  /// SnapLock volume, you can't re-enable it. The default value is DISABLED .
  /// For more information, see Privileged delete .
  pub privileged_delete: PrivilegedDelete? = None
  /// Specifies the retention period of an FSx for ONTAP SnapLock volume.
  pub retention_period: SnaplockRetentionPeriod? = None
  /// Enables or disables volume-append mode on an FSx for ONTAP SnapLock
